## 4. Capital deposit freeze: the attacker deposits as much again as the pool's LP counter around
sampling instructions (capital only, no swap fee) and around one crank every second from the adoption
(up-freeze).  'M4R without the guard' is an analysis row: the exit reference would read the frozen L_ema.

