A dump inside the 60-s window (after the proposal that opened it) is judged only by the execution, at
P_ema (M4X-3): adopted under both rules; the warm-up then re-seeds P_ema at the live price (opens and
tiers see the pool as it is).  A re-check at the execution against P_cand would either revert (and hold
every other proposal, M4V-4) or cancel (and let a dump-wrapped execution cancel windows until S3).

